Author: obnox
Date: 2007-06-13 10:32:57 +0000 (Wed, 13 Jun 2007)
New Revision: 23462

WebSVN: http://websvn.samba.org/cgi-bin/viewcvs.cgi?view=rev&root=samba&rev=23462

Log:
Merge r20209 from 3_0:

Fix two memleaks.


